# Clean Architecture

## Dependency rule
`presentation` → `domain` ← `data`

- **Domain** has zero Flutter UI and zero third-party SDK imports.
- **Data** implements domain contracts; owns DTOs, datasources, adapters.
- **Presentation** talks to use cases / repositories via domain APIs only.

## Feature layout
```
lib/features/<feature>/{domain,data,presentation}
lib/core/{theme,widgets,error,network,constants,utils}
lib/app/   # bootstrap, root app, DI composition
```

TV vs Companion UI split under `presentation/tv` and `presentation/companion`. Shared visual atoms live in `lib/core/widgets`.

## MVP feature map
`auth`, `home`, `live_tv`, `player`, `catalog`, `sources`, `sync`, `devices`, `search`, `settings`, `favorites`.

## Adapters (required for externals)
Catalog/sources: M3U, Xtream, proprietary → canonical domain model.  
Player: wrap Media3/ExoPlayer (or approved engine) behind `MediaPlayerController`.  
Storage/network/secure prefs: adapter interfaces; never call plugins from widgets/use cases directly.

## File size
Prefer < ~250 lines per file. Split by responsibility before a file becomes a grab-bag.
